-- ============================================================================
-- QI PROFESSIONAL DEEP SEED: Quantitative Interpretation, intermediate tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json rather than hand typed, and the question rows from the
-- committed bank JSONs under tools/course-banks/qi/intermediate.
--
-- What this tier owns: FROM THE TIE TO AVO ON THE SEISMIC. Statistical and
-- well wavelets, phase, the bulk shift, anchors and the time-depth record, one
-- field wavelet; offset gathers, NMO stretch and its mute, residual moveout
-- and fold; Dix, Walden's angle, angle gathers, partial stacks and the usable
-- angle; the Shuey fit, intercept and gradient, the background trend, the
-- fluid factor and chi; AVO at the wells.
--
-- AN APP COURSE. The Suite app is QI Studio; the practicals also run in the
-- course's own explorer panels. The tier's capstone grades six values on a
-- held-out synthetic case, each a return value of a vendored engine. No BEGIN
-- or COMMIT: apply_qi.sh wraps this file in one transaction.
-- ============================================================================

values ('qi', 'intermediate', '{"modules":[{"key":"m01-from-feasibility-to-the-tie","title":"From Feasibility to the Tie","lesson_keys":["l01-what-the-professional-tier-adds","l02-the-synthetic-in-one-lesson","l03-statistical-and-well-wavelets","l04-phase-and-correlation"]},{"key":"m02-the-tie-and-the-field-wavelet","title":"The Tie and the Field Wavelet","lesson_keys":["l01-bulk-shift-and-anchors","l02-the-time-depth-record","l03-comparing-wavelets-across-wells","l04-aligning-and-averaging-one-field-wavelet","l05-when-one-well-disagrees"]},{"key":"m03-gathers-and-their-qc","title":"Gathers and Their QC","lesson_keys":["l01-offset-gathers-and-bin-width","l02-nmo-stretch-and-the-stretch-mute","l03-residual-moveout","l04-fold-and-what-it-limits"]},{"key":"m04-angles-from-velocity","title":"Angles from Velocity","lesson_keys":["l01-rms-to-interval-velocity","l02-waldens-straight-ray-angle","l03-angle-gathers-and-ranges","l04-partial-stacks-and-the-usable-angle"]},{"key":"m05-avo-volumes","title":"AVO Volumes","lesson_keys":["l01-the-shuey-fit-from-near-mid-and-far","l02-intercept-and-gradient-volumes","l03-the-background-trend-and-off-trend-distance","l04-the-fluid-factor-and-the-chi-projection","l05-conditioning-before-avo"]},{"key":"m06-avo-at-the-wells","title":"AVO at the Wells","lesson_keys":["l01-one-scale-over-every-well","l02-class-agreement-and-misfit","l03-what-a-disagreement-means","l04-the-capstone-brief"]}]}'::jsonb, 1)
on conflict (app_slug, tier) do update
  set structure = excluded.structure,
      content_version = excluded.content_version,
      active = true,
